    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really nervous about calling the doctor so much lol. it doesnt really hurt that bad, just feels really heavy. and like i said it's just kinda warm. do u think it's just part of the normal inflammation from the surgery? like can i just keep it elevated and maybe take some extra ibuprofen to help with the heat/swelling?",
